    [BugFix][MRV2] Preserve hybrid dummy query widths with DP and MTP (#19165)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Extend #18038 to hybrid targets. PIECEWISE dummy padding currently
    changes their logical query width, so MTP fails when reusing the
    target's DP synchronization state.
    
    Preserve the scheduled dummy queries and pass the padded input extent
    separately through Mamba attention metadata. Re-enable `test_hang` on
    MRV2 with DP2/EP, MTP3, PIECEWISE capture size 12 and three prompts at
    the context boundary.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    N/A
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/a98247ab4db686ee03c66d5feb3c761e52a2f8ab
    
    Signed-off-by: jiajinzhu2 <jiajinzhu@huawei.com>

